&lt;p style=&quot;display: none;&quot;&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.thoughtworks.com/careers/ai-policy-for-recruitment&quot;&gt;See here our AI policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;description content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an Agentic AI Principal to act as a senior technical authority and trusted client advisor for complex agentic AI transformation in Germany, the Netherlands and the wider DACH region.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Operating at Principal level, you will shape enterprise AI strategy, define agentic architecture blueprints, lead high-value C-suite engagements and guide complex programmes from opportunity through delivery. You will bring deep hands-on credibility in multi-agent systems, governance and safeguards, while setting reusable patterns and raising capability across teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role has particular focus on sovereign, compliant and production-grade agentic AI for regulated German, Dutch and European enterprises, with a primary focus on healthcare and life sciences (pharma, biotech, medtech and healthcare providers). Experience from other regulated sectors, such as financial services and insurance, automotive and manufacturing, energy and telecommunications, is equally welcome.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our delivery model is moving from large time-and-materials teams to small, AI-first, multidisciplinary pods accountable to a business outcome. You will anchor the agentic side of that work, pairing with our data, tech advisory and industry domain leads from presale through delivery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a client-facing, builder&#39;s leadership role. You will start with a small, senior team and grow it through technical depth, delivery excellence and thought leadership, rather than inheriting a large organisation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;job-responsibilities&quot;&gt;Job responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-responsibilities content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shaping and winning&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agentic AI advisory and strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; shape and solution complex German, Dutch and DACH pursuits with account, commercial and delivery leaders, translating client needs into differentiated propositions, credible architectures and executable delivery approaches that support regional pipeline conversion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independently drive complex pursuits with technical and executive stakeholders, including shaping the commercial model (fixed-price, outcome-linked), trade-offs and risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a sparring partner to C-suite buyers (CEO, CIO, CDO, CISO, COO): frame business-outcome hypotheses, challenge assumptions and define a thin slice of agentic delivery that proves value quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead AI maturity assessments, identify and prioritise processes for agentisation, and connect architecture choices to measurable business value and ROI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Thoughtworks&#39; agentic AI expertise in strategic client conversations, industry forums, partnerships and thought leadership where appropriate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Designing and building&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design and build engineering:&lt;/strong&gt; set the architecture direction for complex, production-grade agentic AI systems, including multi-agent workflows, orchestration, tool use, memory, context strategy, retrieval, evaluation, observability and enterprise integration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate agents with the German enterprise core: SAP (S/4HANA, BTP), LIMS, QMS and clinical systems, MES/PLM and industrial systems, and legacy back-office platforms, using open protocols such as MCP and A2A where they fit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure agents run on trustworthy data foundations, working with data engineering and data product teams on data quality, semantics and access.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design solutions for regulated German and EU environments, with strong consideration of data sovereignty (EU and German sovereign cloud, open-weight or self-hosted models where required), privacy, security, responsible AI and applicable regulation, including the EU AI Act and GDPR; for healthcare and life sciences GxP, EU MDR/IVDR and the European Health Data Space; and for other sectors DORA, NIS2 and BaFin requirements where relevant.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide teams in balancing rapid experimentation with robust production engineering, including evaluation-driven development, testing, CI/CD, reliability, cost and performance optimisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide technical and delivery leadership for complex programmes, staying hands-on enough to validate architecture, unblock teams, manage technical risk and ensure successful execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with product, data, software engineering, enterprise architecture, governance and change specialists to design end-to-end solutions that deliver measurable business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Governance and safeguards&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish reusable patterns for observability, auditability, traceability and control of agentic systems, enabling teams to demonstrate safe and reliable behaviour in production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate EU AI Act obligations (risk classification, human oversight, logging, technical documentation, GPAI-provider responsibilities) into concrete engineering controls and evidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage early with works councils (Betriebsrat, ondernemingsraad), data protection officers and information security, supporting DPIAs and co-determination processes so agentic solutions that touch employee workflows can go live.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Anticipate technical, organisational and governance challenges in enterprise AI adoption and define practical approaches to address them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Principal-level leadership and growing capability&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set reusable architecture patterns, engineering standards and governance practices across multiple teams and engagements, influencing the evolution of Thoughtworks&#39; agentic AI capability beyond an individual programme.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set technical direction across multiple teams and initiatives, defining reusable patterns, frameworks and engineering standards for agentic AI delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor senior engineers and technical leads, build the next generation of the German team, and raise AI fluency and agentic engineering standards across specialists and generalists.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate emerging agentic AI technologies and frameworks and guide their responsible adoption based on client context, engineering quality and business value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build our German and Dutch market presence through local-language points of view, ecosystem and partner initiatives (hyperscalers, SAP, European model providers) and community events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;job-qualifications&quot;&gt;Job qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-qualifications content&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;technical-skills&quot;&gt;Technical Skills&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;qualifications inner-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in modern software engineering and Python, with a strong track record of setting standards for testing, CI/CD, observability, maintainability and production reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recognised experience architecting and delivering complex GenAI and agentic AI systems at enterprise scale, from early discovery through production deployment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of agentic architectures and frameworks such as LangGraph, AutoGen, CrewAI, LlamaIndex or equivalent, including tool use, orchestration, memory, multi-agent coordination and interoperability protocols (MCP, A2A).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong expertise in Retrieval-Augmented Generation, advanced information retrieval, vector databases and enterprise knowledge integration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing evaluation strategies for GenAI and agentic systems, including quality, safety, reliability, latency and cost measures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of AI governance and safeguards, including guardrails, red-teaming, observability, responsible AI and secure deployment practices (prompt injection, data leakage, tool misuse).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience deploying AI systems on major cloud platforms using containers, orchestration and production-grade infrastructure patterns, including EU sovereign cloud, hybrid or on-premises setups and self-hosted open-weight models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with model adaptation and optimisation techniques, including prompt/context engineering, fine-tuning where appropriate, and application-level performance optimisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to make sound architecture trade-offs across model capability, reliability, security, compliance, performance and cost.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of the EU AI Act, GDPR and sector rules (for healthcare and life sciences: GxP and GAMP 5 computerised-system validation, EU MDR/IVDR, EHDS; for other sectors: DORA, NIS2, BaFin) and how they shape agentic system design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strongly preferred: &lt;/strong&gt;delivering AI in healthcare or life sciences (e.g. R&amp;amp;D, clinical, regulatory, manufacturing quality, commercial).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nice to have: integrating agents with SAP and industrial or manufacturing systems; data product and data platform foundations for AI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Consulting and Commercial Track Record&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;skills inner-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to lead C-suite and senior client engagements, rapidly establish credibility and advise on both business and technical choices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong consulting and commercial judgement: you can point to data and AI (ideally agentic or GenAI) pursuits you helped shape, sell and deliver in the last three to five years, from around €3M–5M upwards, including fixed-price or outcome-linked elements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience shaping, solutioning, selling and delivering complex deals of €5M+ in the last few years. Annual target of solutioning, selling and delivering €10M+ TCV in Data &amp;amp; AI deals with an AI-first delivery focus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable discussing P&amp;amp;L, business cases and ROI with executive buyers, not just architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consultancy or professional-services experience within the last five years, ideally with German, Dutch or DACH enterprise clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have grown a practice, capability or go-to-market asset (e.g. a reusable accelerator).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Professional Skills&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executive presence and communication skills, making complex agentic AI concepts, risks and trade-offs clear to technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven leadership of complex delivery across multidisciplinary teams, moving fluidly between strategy, architecture, governance and hands-on technical leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to influence across organisations without formal authority, align diverse stakeholders and navigate ambiguity in high-value or high-risk programmes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to mentor senior engineers and technical leaders and raise standards across a wider engineering community.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-directed, prioritisation-led working style, with creative problem-solving in fixed-scope, outcome-driven work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience navigating German stakeholder structures, including works councils, data protection officers and procurement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;German B2 minimum&lt;/strong&gt;, C1 strongly preferred; fluent English.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;important-things&quot;&gt;Other things to know&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;important-things content&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Development&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;inner-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;There is no one-size-fits-all career path at Thoughtworks: however you want to develop your career is entirely up to you. But we also balance autonomy with the strength of our cultivation culture. This means your career is supported by interactive tools, numerous development programs and teammates who want to help you grow. We see value in helping each other be our best and that extends to empowering our employees in their career journeys.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;responsible-ai-use&quot;&gt;Responsible Use of AI in Recruitment&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;responsible-ai-use content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Thoughtworks, we use AI tools to support our recruitment team with administrative tasks such as drafting communications, scheduling interviews and writing job descriptions.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Crucially, our AI tools do not screen, assess, rank or make hiring decisions. Every application is reviewed by our team and all selection decisions are made exclusively by our interviewers and hiring managers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are committed to fairness and responsible AI. We actively manage our AI systems by testing, monitoring for biased outcomes and implementing mitigation measures. We hold our third-party vendors to these same high standards through a rigorous governance process. For additional information, please see our full &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.thoughtworks.com/careers/ai-policy-for-recruitment&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Thoughtworks AI Policy for Recruitment&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;about&quot;&gt;About Thoughtworks&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;about content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thoughtworks is a dynamic and inclusive community of bright and supportive colleagues who are revolutionizing tech. As a leading technology consultancy, we’re pushing boundaries through our purposeful and impactful work. For 30+ years, we’ve delivered extraordinary impact together with our clients by helping them solve complex business problems with technology as the differentiator. Bring your brilliant expertise and commitment for continuous learning to Thoughtworks. Together, let’s be extraordinary.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;display: none;&quot;&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.thoughtworks.com/careers/ai-policy-for-recruitment&quot;&gt;See here our AI policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At Superchat, we&#39;re rebuilding how businesses talk to their customers. The phone call, the contact form, the support ticket: all of it is being replaced by messaging and AI. We&#39;re building the platform that runs underneath.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2020, Superchat has become the platform of choice for &lt;strong&gt;10,000+ businesses worldwide&lt;/strong&gt;, from globally recognized brands like Allianz, Auto1, Enpal, Danone, and GASAG to the small businesses, dental practices, and one-person startups that need to look bigger than they are. Today, &lt;strong&gt;millions of messages flow through Superchat every single day&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We started as a unified inbox: one place for every channel a customer might pick, WhatsApp, email, SMS, Instagram. Then ChatGPT happened, and the second chapter began: AI agents that respond across chat, email, and voice at the quality of the best human teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re &lt;strong&gt;100 people&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;profitable&lt;/strong&gt;, and have raised &lt;strong&gt;€18M in funding&lt;/strong&gt; (last round 4.5 years ago, we&#39;ve been growing on our own money since). Headquartered in Berlin.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are hiring a backend-leaning Tech Lead to lead a team of 3-4 engineers and own the tech for a part of Superchat’s product.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on leadership role: You’ll spend roughly half your time designing and building software and the other half enabling your team to perform at its best. Work directly on architecture, development and important projects while creating the clarity, feedback and environment your engineers need to deliver an excellent product&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Want&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A strong, current backend engineer.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You bring 3+ years of experience as a Senior or Staff Engineer and remain deeply involved in software development. You are comfortable owning, designing and building crucial parts of production systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experienced with the JVM ecosystem.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You have substantial experience with Java or another JVM language. Kotlin and AWS experience are a plus, since our backend runs on Kotlin/Quarkus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ready to lead people.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You have at least 2 years of experience in a leadership role, whether as a Tech Lead, Engineering Manager, or through leading projects and owning architecture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong at delivery.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You know how to turn product goals into reality. You are used to work in fast-paced startups and are a driver to increase velocity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product-minded.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You care about solving the customers problem. You engage with product decisions, challenge assumptions constructivly and find pragmatic solutions to build things in a lean way.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clear communicator.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You are able to explain complex technical things in details to Engineers and in an understandable way to non-technical stakeholders. You create alignment and motivate people&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Excited about AI-assisted development.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You are already using AI in your development workflow and are eager to explore how it can improve engineering speed, quality and the way teams work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Don’t Want&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pure people manager.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You no longer want to work directly on software. This role requires meaningful, ongoing involvement in architecture, implementation, code review, and technical problem-solving.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hero engineer.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You want to make every important technical decision yourself or become the bottleneck for the team. Your job is to raise the effectiveness of the whole team, not to be the only person who can solve difficult problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pure delivery manager.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You treat engineering as a ticketing operation focused only on timelines and task tracking instead of product quality, technical health, and team growth. We need engineering leaders, not project coordinators.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Remote-only operator.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You prefer fully remote work and don’t want to actively build relationships and culture in person with the team. We believe strong engineering leadership requires regular in-person collaboration and presence in Berlin.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Day To Day&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spend approximately 50% of your time contributing directly to architecture, development, code reviews, and important technical projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead a team of 3-4 engineers and take responsibility for its effectiveness, technical quality, and delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with your Product Manager to understand customer problems, shape solutions, scope projects, and set priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish clear technical direction while enabling engineers to own decisions and develop their judgment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run regular 1:1s, give actionable feedback, and support each engineer’s development and performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remove blockers, manage dependencies, and help the team identify delivery risks early.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve engineering practices and explore effective uses of AI throughout the software-development lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to hiring through technical interviews, structured feedback, and candidate conversations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholders&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Director of Engineering:&lt;/strong&gt; Your manager and partner on people development, calibration, processes.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Direct Reports: &lt;/strong&gt;Engineers in your team; you own their development, performance and growth&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Manager:&lt;/strong&gt; PMs own what and why; you own how (delivery) and who (people)&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CTO and CPO: &lt;/strong&gt;We are a lean organization with a flat hierarchy. You will regulary disccuss the direction of architecture with the CTO and product with the CPO&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Why People Choose Us&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mission that matters. &lt;/strong&gt;Real impact on small businesses, not abstract metrics&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Funded with conviction. &lt;/strong&gt;$18M raised and profitable&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Modern stack. &lt;/strong&gt;Kotlin/Quarkus, AWS, TypeScript/React/Next.js, and LangGraph for AI-powered features&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Squad-based organization. &lt;/strong&gt;Each squad owns its domain end-to-end with real ownership and autonomy&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Two clear career tracks&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt; We support both individual contributor growth (up to Staff level) and Management Paths with explicit reversibility between both and Tech Lead being the first level of management that is still quite hands-on&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product-led structure. &lt;/strong&gt;PMs report directly to the CPO, keeping product strategy focused, consistent, and clearly prioritized&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid by design. &lt;/strong&gt;Our Berlin office in Prenzlauer Berg is the center of gravity, with two work-from-home days as the standard setup&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Direct feedback culture. &lt;/strong&gt;Honest, direct, and kind feedback is part of how we work together - in 1:1s, retrospectives, and everyday collaboration&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits &amp;amp; Culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Choose between an Urban Sports Club/John Reed membership or a public transport/Dance subscription&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular company and team events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual personal development budget of €500 for conferences, courses, books, career coaching, and more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An inclusive and exciting startup culture that enables fast professional and personal growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Beautiful office in the heart of Berlin (Prenzlauer Allee 242) with free snacks, drinks, and top-notch equipment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We want to build a community, not just a company.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It’s important to us to create an environment where people genuinely enjoy spending time together - whether that’s through HYROX training, golfing, beer pong tournaments, running clubs, Warhammer, weekend activities, or whatever kind of community you’d like to help build here!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;re looking for people with passion, grit, and integrity. You&#39;re encouraged to apply even if your experience doesn&#39;t precisely match the description. At Superchat, we welcome diverse perspectives and people who think rigorously.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Relocating to Berlin? We support you with practical relocation help. You&#39;ll feel home in no time.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We look forward to your application! 🙂&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;With your application you agree to our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.notion.so/f601741cb4f24d418411aa0ff86c3787?pvs=21&quot;&gt;privacy policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i.imgur.com/Uicf3C7.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;800&quot; style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior IT Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to join the &lt;strong&gt;Mobile Device Management (MDM) Tribe at HelloFresh&lt;/strong&gt;. As a senior individual contributor, you will play a key role in designing, optimizing, and evolving our endpoint management environment across &lt;strong&gt;macOS, Windows, and mobile platforms&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will bring deep expertise in &lt;strong&gt;Microsoft Intune, Jamf Pro&lt;/strong&gt; combined with a strong understanding of endpoint security, identity, automation, and modern device management practices. You will help shape our MDM strategy, drive technical improvements, and ensure a secure, scalable, and exceptional user experience.This is an &lt;strong&gt;Individual Contributor (IC)&lt;/strong&gt; role with a strong focus on technical ownership, architecture, automation, continuous improvement, and knowledge sharing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all, we are looking for people who will&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;make HelloFresh&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;better.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We believe there are many different ways of developing skills and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design&lt;/strong&gt;, implement, and continuously improve scalable MDM solutions across macOS, Windows, iOS, and Android, balancing security, compliance, and user experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define&lt;/strong&gt; and maintain MDM standards, policies, configuration profiles, application management, and compliance controls aligned with HelloFresh security and business requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leverage&lt;/strong&gt; PowerShell, Bash, and Microsoft Graph API to automate device management, compliance, reporting, remediation, and enforcement workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
