&lt;li&gt;Strong experience in one or more of our core client platforms: Web (JavaScript/TypeScript), iOS (Swift) or Android (Kotlin). We&#39;re just as keen to hear from native engineers as web engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of Agile software development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A focus on quality and testing in your code&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to hold yourself and the team to high standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to provide in-depth evaluation of multiple technical directions and determine tradeoffs of each&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Cloud technologies, ideally AWS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;As a senior member of the team, we&#39;d also expect you to be comfortable:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributing to the team&#39;s design, scoping and prioritisation discussions, helping the team provide solutions that make our Products better and enjoyed by more people&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading smaller projects of work within the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coaching &amp;amp; nurturing other members of the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participating in the interview process and helping your team onboard &amp;amp; train Software Engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;What We Can Do For You&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We treat our team right&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Join an open and collaborative organisation that value and respect each other and are committed to driving real growth. Help build great products that fans love and refine your game through our mentorship and professional development.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
