&lt;p&gt;We are now building services and agentic tools that provide AI coding agents and end users with deeper context about codebases. Our code retrieval service already delivers meaningful improvements in agent speed and task performance, and we aim to push this further – extracting richer insights than snippets alone at the scale of several hundred thousand repositories.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Check this out to find out more about our product: https://www.jetbrains.com/context/&lt;/p&gt;
