&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Our&amp;nbsp;team interacts with experts from various domains such as&amp;nbsp;Digital Building Planning and Automation, Product Operations,&amp;nbsp;Sustainability, AI, IoT, construction engineers, building architects,&amp;nbsp;logistics&amp;nbsp;experts, software engineering;&amp;nbsp;solving&amp;nbsp;complex challenges&amp;nbsp;pertaining to&amp;nbsp;end-to-end&amp;nbsp;process for planning, building, and&amp;nbsp;operating&amp;nbsp;a building.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
