&lt;h4&gt;About the role :&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At the heart of our offering is a versatile software platform for orchestrating complex robotic systems, from industrial robot arms and mobile manipulators to humanoids. We bring it into real production environments with international customers and delivery partners, often in applications nobody has automated before.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Technical Lead, you are one of the people we turn to when it matters most. When a critical project hits a wall, whether the problem is technical, organizational, or both, you step in, get to the root of it, and get it back on track. You work at the staff level alongside product and project management, and your judgment shapes what we build: which problems the platform solves next, how projects are scoped, and where the technical boundaries lie.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Your Responsibilities :&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take technical ownership of our most critical customer projects and turn around those that are off track.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Diagnose problems across the whole system: robot hardware, controls, perception, AI models, software, and integration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make the call on technical direction when there is no obvious answer, and stand behind it with customers, partners, and management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Step into project leadership where needed: re-plan scope, reset expectations, and get the team moving again.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape the product roadmap with what you learn in the field, and turn one-off solutions into platform capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Challenge and sharpen the project scope early, before commitments are made, together with Sales, Pre-Sales, and project management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a technical counterpart for senior customer and partner stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach engineers across teams, and raise the technical bar by example.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Essential Skills&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Master&#39;s degree or PhD in Robotics, Computer Science, Mechatronics, Electrical or Mechanical Engineering, or a comparable field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of hands-on experience in robotics, gained in a startup, a research institute, or a comparable environment where you had to cover a broad range of topics yourself.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep technical knowledge across several of these: motion planning and control, perception and computer vision, robot learning or AI models, real-time and embedded systems, and software architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of solving hard problems in real deployments, not just in the lab.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident in taking on project management responsibility when the situation calls for it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear communicator who can explain complex technical situations to engineers, customers, and management alike.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Calm, pragmatic, and decisive under pressure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent English; willingness to travel to customer sites when a project needs you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Beneficial Skills&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent German; Mandarin is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with humanoids, mobile manipulation, or Vision-Language-Action models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a product company where customer projects drive platform development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with industrial communication protocols, machinery, and functional safety&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItemName___Q0F_7 TranslationField-module__aboutUsWrapper___WXJpq&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;A dynamic high-tech company, combined with financial soundness and world-class investors.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Join an interdisciplinary, international team with 60+ different nationalities in a collaborative work environment.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Lots of development opportunities as we continue to grow.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Challenging tasks and impactful projects alongside experts that enable professional and personal growth.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Corporate Benefits Program covering health, mobility, and learning for 100€ net per month.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Modern office facilities with a rooftop terrace overlooking Munich, free drinks &amp;amp; fruits, and regular company events contribute to a good working environment&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItemValue___c0djd&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agile Robots SE&lt;/strong&gt; is an international high-tech company based in Munich, Germany with a production site in Kaufbeuren and more than &lt;strong&gt;3500&lt;/strong&gt; employees worldwide. Our mission is to bridge the gap between artificial intelligence and robotics by developing systems that combine state-of-the-art force-moment-sensing and world-leading image-processing technology. This unique combination of technologies allows us to provide user-friendly and affordable robotic solutions that enable intelligent precision assembly.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is made possible by our employees, who bring out the best in each and every day with creativity and enthusiasm. Become part of this team and shape the future of robotics with us!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are proud of our diversity and welcome your application regardless of gender and sexual identity, nationality, ethnicity, religion, age, or disability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;About Wolt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;At Wolt, we create technology that brings joy, simplicity and earnings to the neighborhoods of the world. In 2014 we started with delivery of restaurant food. Now we’re building the delivery of (almost) everything and you’ll find us in over 500 cities in 30 countries around the world. In 2022 we joined forces with DoorDash and together we keep on dreaming big and expanding across the globe.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Working at Wolt isn’t always easy, but it’s definitely exciting. Here you’ll learn more, build more, and ship more than in most other companies. You’ll be challenged a lot, but also have a lot of fun on the way. So, if you’re a self-starter with drive and entrepreneurial spirit, this could be the ride of your life.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Support Group&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the name Support Group implies, this group is responsible for the core part of the customer experience journey that has got Wolt top-notch ratings in app stores.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;During the years we’ve invested a lot in the in-house built support tooling as we believe that it’s the only way we can ensure the satisfaction of all of our customers and partners in each of the 25 countries that we operate in. We take huge pride in our customer operations’ quality, so on top of building delightful support experiences in our consumer app we also want to proactively identify and solve issues even before our customers and partners even notice something might be wrong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Support Analytics Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Support Analytics team’s main goal is to deliver an amazing Customer, Merchants &amp;amp; Courier support experience while optimizing our operations by providing actionable insights and quantifying the impact of those actions on the overall business. 💡&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be part of this team working with top Data Science and Analytics Engineering professionals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Data Scientist at Wolt, your role involves diving into our data to solve crucial business problems. The scope of this role ranges from diagnosing problem areas to identifying solutions to designing experiments and ultimately influencing decision-making. This is a rare, operational, and actionable data-driven experience. When you join this team, you will be driving action from the frontlines, rather than just doing yet another analytics role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your job will mainly focus on driving operational efficiency with the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Workforce Management (WFM) &lt;/strong&gt;team and optimizing resource allocation by creating accurate scheduling and intraday forecasts, simplifying forecasting processes, building and supporting KPI dashboards, conducting root cause analysis for SLA improvements, exploring cost optimization opportunities, managing the capacity plan framework, enhancing the WFM data pipeline, and uncovering data-driven insights to refine planning, scheduling, reporting, and intraday management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Our humble expectations&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Required:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5+ years of experience&lt;/strong&gt; in a data science or analytics position&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building&lt;strong&gt; forecasting models and time series analysis&lt;/strong&gt; (Prophet, SARIMA, Holt-Winters or similar)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in&lt;strong&gt; Cost Analysis and What-if Scenario Analysis&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of statistical packages in &lt;strong&gt;Python or R&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in writing structured and efficient&lt;strong&gt; SQL queries&lt;/strong&gt; for large data sets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to&lt;strong&gt; influence and advise senior stakeholders &lt;/strong&gt;Good to have:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using ML for forecasting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with ML engineers/ML platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building data pipelines using Airflow or similar tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we offer&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The online delivery platform that Wolt is building will offer you interesting and complex challenges, together with the opportunities to create a big impact with your skills. Lots of geolocational and temporal data in real-time, combined with differences in the economics and dynamics of the cities we operate in, make Wolt both a challenging and interesting company to practice analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have the chance to decide the ways of working: a hybrid, at the office, or remote in &lt;strong&gt;Berlin. &lt;/strong&gt;💙&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You would get to work in a company culture where we take ownership beyond the obvious, do common things uncommonly well, we think big but stay humble, do right by people, we treat others kindly and justly, recognize that if we don’t learn, we won’t stay still but fall behind and keep in mind that Luke was Yoda’s greatest achievement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Next steps&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The position will be filled as soon as we find the right person, so make sure to apply as soon as you realize you really, really want to join us!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For any further questions about the position, you can turn to Senior Talent Acquisition Partner - Zhanna Filintseva via &lt;a ----------
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/Ncz4s_oBczc?si=FzuwoSOLcv5WZVRN&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;We’re committed to growing and empowering a more inclusive community within our company, industry, and cities. That’s why we hire and cultivate diverse teams of people from all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives. We believe that true innovation happens when everyone has room at the table and the tools, resources, and opportunity to excel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DoorDash, Deliveroo, and Wolt will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about our legitimate recruiting process at &lt;span class=&quot;_80om1qgj _1e0c1nu9&quot; data-testid=&quot;smart-link-draggable-inline&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;loader-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;hover-card-trigger-wrapper&quot; data-testid=&quot;hover-card-trigger-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;_1yt4x7n9 _2rko1ssi _v56415x0 _1e0c1nu9 _16d9qvcn _syaz13af _1rkwglyw _4cvx1w55 _19itia51 _bfhkhp5a _1a3b18uv _4fprglyw _5goinqa1 _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _uizt1kdv _nt751r31 _49pcglyw _1hvw1o36 _1372tlke _7ehiw5lj _1j5pglyw _1di615s3&quot; href=&quot;https://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-testid=&quot;inline-card-resolved-view&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw _o5721jtm _1nmz9jpi _16d9qvcn _ca0qv77o _u5f31b66 _n3tdv77o _19bv1b66&quot; data-testid=&quot;inline-card-icon-and-title&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw&quot;&gt;Recruitment Scam Awareness - DoorDash&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; .&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;section class=&quot;section vacancy-detail-intro-section&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section-inner&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;entry-intro&quot;&gt;
&lt;section class=&quot;section vacancy-detail-intro-section&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section-inner&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;entry-intro&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In a nutshell&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Fulfilment Centers are among the most advanced of their kind, delivering fresh groceries to thousands of households every day. Next, we are planning to open our brand-new hybrid Fulfilment Center in the Berlin/Brandenburg area (Falkensee). Falkensee will be one of the first sites where we build our internal maintenance function for automated equipment. As Technical Site Manager (m/f/d) - Maintenance Operations &amp;amp; Continuous Improvement, you will take strategic ownership of the performance and continuous development of our material handling equipment and maintenance processes on site.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will act as the key interface between the automated and manual processes within the Fulfilment Center, the operational teams, your Maintenance team, our Engineering and Analytics teams, and external partners. You will translate overarching site goals into concrete improvement initiatives, use data to identify optimization opportunities, and ensure that equipment availability, operational efficiency, and continuous improvement remain at a high level in the long term.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/50pQKpPc24E&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-on leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead the Maintenance value stream day-by-day, coaching Maintenance Engineers and Supervisors to effectively lead their teams and ensuring equipment availability targets are met with indirect leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Value Stream Ownership: &lt;/strong&gt;Define and execute the long-term performance roadmap, taking full ownership of structural strategy and high-level KPIs across safety, quality, throughput, and operational efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Continuous Improvement &amp;amp; Operational Excellence: &lt;/strong&gt;Lead site-wide Kaizen initiatives, Lean methodologies, and root-cause analyses to drive structural process enhancements and embed a culture of continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data-Driven Process &amp;amp; Automation Optimization: &lt;/strong&gt;Analyze complex operational and maintenance workflows using data to eliminate bottlenecks, boost system reliability, and improve equipment availability alongside technical teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Strategic Alignment: &lt;/strong&gt;Act as the strategic bridge between maintenance, our suppliers, planning, analysts, and operations to ensure seamless, end-to-end operational flow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Standards &amp;amp; Governance: &lt;/strong&gt;Oversee site-wide adherence to safety standards, 5S principles, and operational best practices without getting bogged down in daily engineering management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Master’s degree (MSc) in Supply Chain Management, Engineering, or a related technical field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience focused on maintenance, operational strategy, continuous improvement, or process engineering&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Min. 2+ years of direct managerial/people management experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interest in, or exposure to, automation, robotics, and facility maintenance systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record in applying Lean, Six Sigma, or Kaizen frameworks in high-volume, automated environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High analytical proficiency, with strong capability in data analysis tools (e.g., Tableau, Excel, SQL)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic mindset with the ability to influence cross-functional teams and drive high-level initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English (German is a strong plus)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you can look forward to&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Smart Commute:&lt;/strong&gt; Choose the way you move. You will get a company car (with private use) and can make use of our “Lease-a-Bike” program.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Time to recharge: &lt;/strong&gt;With 30 days of vacation per year (based on a 40-hour workweek in a shift system), you can strike the perfect balance between work and leisure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fuel for Winners:&lt;/strong&gt; Enjoy fresh, free breakfasts and lunches every day in our Fulfilment Center, along with all the snacks and fruit you need to stay fueled.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kickstart your career:&lt;/strong&gt; Join our international team in an environment that fosters real growth and an “Act like an Owner” mentality. Here, you’ll have the chance to drive projects independently, test new ideas, and level up through specialized trainings to see firsthand how your work makes an impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sustainability at Core:&lt;/strong&gt; Be part of the revolution. You’ll contribute to a greener future through our 100% electric fleet and a business model designed to drastically reduce food waste.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Essentials:&lt;/strong&gt; We provide the tools for success, including a laptop and phone, and access to exclusive Corporate Benefits discounts for travel, tech and more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unforgettable Moments:&lt;/strong&gt; From our legendary annual ski trip, our massive Christmas parties, to parties featuring our very own Picnic band, we make sure our milestones are celebrated in style.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Well-being &amp;amp; Balance:&lt;/strong&gt; Professional mental health support via OpenUp.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

